      "3. new_domain_signature  (new provider commits to host alice@new.example)",
      "4. old_domain_signature  (cooperative only: old provider commits to forwarding)"
    ],
    "canonical_form": "Sorted keys, no whitespace, UTF-8. At signature N, signatures 1..N-1 are at final values; signature N is blanked; signatures N+1..4 are blanked."
